{"id":"launcher","name":"Lifecycle launcher","summary":"A CRM webhook and a daily schedule feed it. Each coloured zone is one step of the advisor's journey, from payment to the first day of offboarding.","w":12204,"h":7036,"zones":[{"label":"Missing documents","group":"Onboarding","color":"#ff7a45","desc":"A required file is missing: the deal moves to “Missing items”, the owner gets a Slack message and a CRM task.","x":6436,"y":1684,"w":2512,"h":224,"count":11},{"label":"Onboarding launch","group":"Onboarding","color":"#ff7a45","desc":"Payment received: the deal is created or matched, the phone number normalised, a personal document link emailed, and the deal moved to “Waiting for documents”.","x":5828,"y":2756,"w":6016,"h":720,"count":37},{"label":"Mailbox & learning access","group":"Contract & accesses","color":"#f2b24a","desc":"Professional mailbox created, learning account created and enrolled in module 0, access emails sent, deal to “Active advisor”.","x":5844,"y":3540,"w":4320,"h":416,"count":23},{"label":"Documents overdue","group":"Onboarding","color":"#ff7a45","desc":"A daily sweep finds files waiting too long: reminder email, and a stage change after 15 days.","x":3316,"y":1124,"w":3024,"h":560,"count":16},{"label":"KYC & signed contract","group":"Contract & accesses","color":"#f2b24a","desc":"KYC form, then on signature: data cleaned and formatted, the advisor-platform account created through its API with sponsor and manager, failures alerted.","x":5844,"y":3972,"w":4800,"h":2704,"count":68},{"label":"Welcome email, on demand","group":"Onboarding","color":"#ff7a45","desc":"The same documents email, sendable on its own when someone needs a relaunch, with sponsor details and a log line.","x":5284,"y":484,"w":4784,"h":560,"count":21},{"label":"Contract sent","group":"Contract & accesses","color":"#f2b24a","desc":"When the contract goes out, contact and deal data are refreshed from the signed version.","x":6436,"y":1348,"w":2048,"h":256,"count":7},{"label":"O